# Knobs at their limits on a full-scale sweep: small with no shimmer, then huge with full shimmer, the endless top,
# an interval at the bottom of the range (C1: clamped to an octave down) and at the top (C7: two octaves up).
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2
track fx2
input sweep 30 16000 0.99
preset 0 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p1 255 8
param p2 255 8
note 12 C1 2 127
param p1 240 16
note 20 C7 2 1
param p2 0 24
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
